## 3. UI/UX Philosophy - The "3:00 AM Test"

### Design Assumption
The user is holding a screaming baby at 3:00 AM, in a pitch-black room, with one eye open, operating at 40% cognitive capacity.

### Core Rules
| Rule | Execution |
|------|-----------|
| **Dark Mode Default** | Not a setting - it's the soul of the app |
| **One-Handed Use** | Key interactions in bottom 30% of screen |
| **Fat Finger Standard** | Minimum touch target: 48x48pt |
| **Competence > Cuteness** | Professional tool, not cartoons |
| **Haptic Feedback** | Light tap on confirm, heavy on warning |

