### Security Rules (CRITICAL)
- **NEVER** turn off Row Level Security (RLS) in Supabase
- All queries MUST be scoped to `family_id`
- Store API keys in environment/keychain, NEVER in code
- Audio recordings are **ephemeral** - delete after 48 hours

