## 5. The 3-Stage Lifecycle Architecture

Keeper morphs into three different tools based on child's age:

| Stage | Age | Theme | AI Persona | Primary Anxiety |
|-------|-----|-------|------------|-----------------|
| **Pre-Natal** | Pregnancy | DAWN (Sage/Cream) | "Project Manager" | "Am I prepared?" |
| **Infant** | 0-12 months | MIDNIGHT (Indigo/Dark) | "Night Nurse" | "Is he alive/fed/sleeping?" |
| **Early Ed** | 12-60 months | DAYLIGHT (Primary Colors) | "Pattern Keeper" | "Why is he acting this way?" |

### Stage Detection Logic
```swift
func determineStage(dueDate: Date?, birthDate: Date?) -> LifecycleStage {
    if let due = dueDate, due > Date() {
        return .prenatal
    }
    if let birth = birthDate {
        let months = Calendar.current.dateComponents([.month], from: birth, to: Date()).month ?? 0
        return months < 12 ? .infant : .earlyEd
    }
    return .infant // Default
}
```

