## 7. Database Schema (Supabase)

```sql
-- Core Tables
families (id, invite_code, created_at)
profiles (id, email, family_id, role, created_at)
logs (
    id, family_id, creator_id,
    stage_context, -- 'prenatal', 'infant', 'toddler'
    event_type, raw_text, structured_data,
    is_confirmed, client_updated_at, last_modified_by
)

-- RLS Policy (MANDATORY)
CREATE POLICY "family_access" ON logs
FOR ALL USING (
    family_id IN (
        SELECT family_id FROM profiles WHERE id = auth.uid()
    )
);
```

